# TwinTack Rebuild 2026 — Project Context

This repo is the **wp-content** root for Local site `twintack-rebuild-2026`. Production: https://twintack.com/. Legacy reference: https://github.com/misterlinderman/twintack.

## Scope

- **In scope:** Custom theme (`themes/twintack2025/`), TwinTack custom plugins (`plugins/twintack-*`), docs, Cursor rules
- **Out of scope:** WordPress core, `uploads/`, third-party plugins (WooCommerce, ACF Pro), secrets

## Principles

1. One canonical version per custom plugin — no version-suffixed duplicate folders
2. Minimize diff scope — focused changes only
3. Match existing PHP/JS conventions in ported code before refactoring
4. Test changes in Local before suggesting production deploy
5. Update `docs/PLUGIN_INVENTORY.md` when adding or removing plugins

## Before editing ported files

Read `docs/PROJECT_INTENT.md` and `docs/MIGRATION_CHECKLIST.md`. When consolidating legacy code, prefer merging into existing files over creating parallel implementations.

## Local paths

- Repo root: `wp-content/` (this directory)
- WordPress root: `../` (parent — core and wp-config.php, not in Git)
- Local site: `/Volumes/A&D/Dropbox/Development/Local/twintack-rebuild-2026/`

## Do not commit

Database dumps, API keys, Stripe credentials, license keys, customer PII, or media files.
